      "writtenOn": "2020-07-28T19:00:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the explanation. I think power_button_wait_for_release should return immediately if the button is not pressed. Also, we can predict when a debounce will done if power_button_wait_for_release is called during a debounce. I ended up rewriting power_button_wait_for_release and the debouncer to explain my thoughts:\n\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/2324072",
